{
  "_note": "Hazard Hunt v3 (plan 10 \u00a76.4). Module states m1-m5 come from the stepper. Extra states: close views a learner walks to (catalog reach for small objects), the replay playing (the picker and the replay truck exist only then), and the drawers opened from Now-card buttons (judge form, areas list, causes chart, controls ranking, speak-up). Props and people stream after the first interaction (the module click), so the first exploration state waits for them.",
  "settleMs": 3500,
  "extraStates": [
    {
      "name": "walk-receiving",
      "label": "Walk to the receiving dock",
      "steps": [
        {
          "eval": "document.querySelectorAll('[data-ui=module-step]')[1].click()"
        },
        {
          "wait": 2500
        },
